{"id":"91e60e8883d700dc","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/789_da_Costa_相容逻辑_C_1.md","title":"789 da Costa 相容逻辑 C 1","display":"789_da_Costa_相容逻辑_C_1","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"789-da-Costa-相容逻辑-C_1\">789 da Costa 相容逻辑 C_1</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{C1}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}_{C1}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对象语言原始构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\n\\operatorname{and},\\quad\n\\operatorname{or},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\n\\operatorname{and},\\quad\n\\operatorname{or},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{C1}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{C1}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号约定为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p:=\\operatorname{atom}(p),\n\\qquad\n\\neg A:=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p:=\\operatorname{atom}(p),\n\\qquad\n\\neg A:=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\wedge B:=\\operatorname{and}(A,B),\n\\qquad\nA\\vee B:=\\operatorname{or}(A,B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\wedge B:=\\operatorname{and}(A,B),\n\\qquad\nA\\vee B:=\\operatorname{or}(A,B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\to B:=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\to B:=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_1\">\\(C_1\\)</span> 的良行为或一致性记号不是原始构造子，定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A^\\circ\n:=\n\\neg(A\\wedge\\neg A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A^\\circ\n:=\n\\neg(A\\wedge\\neg A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\)</span> 为满足下列闭包条件的最小集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2.1-原子公式\">2.1 原子公式</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{C1}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{C1}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"2.2-否定公式\">2.2 否定公式</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"2.3-合取公式\">2.3 合取公式</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"2.4-析取公式\">2.4 析取公式</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"2.5-蕴含公式\">2.5 蕴含公式</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与结构等同\">3. 自由变元与结构等同</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{C1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{C1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{C1}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本系统没有绑定构造子。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{C1}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{C1}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{C1}(A)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{C1}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{C1}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{C1}(A)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,C1}\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_{\\alpha,C1}\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,C1}B\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\nA=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_{\\alpha,C1}B\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\nA=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<p>命题替换集合为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{C1}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{C1}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{C1}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{C1}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义替换扩张算子</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}_{C1}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{C1}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ext}_{C1}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{C1}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{C1}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{C1}\\)</span>，令\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma:=\\operatorname{Ext}_{C1}(\\sigma)\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma:=\\operatorname{Ext}_{C1}(\\sigma)\\)</span>；它由下列子句唯一确定：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{and}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{and}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{or}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{or}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由派生记号的定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A^\\circ)=(\\widehat\\sigma(A))^\\circ.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A^\\circ)=(\\widehat\\sigma(A))^\\circ.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为十四个本地公理族的并集：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}\n=\n\\bigcup_{1\\le i\\le14}\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,i}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}\n=\n\\bigcup_{1\\le i\\le14}\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,i}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"5.1-蕴含一\">5.1 蕴含一</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,1}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,1}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"5.2-蕴含二\">5.2 蕴含二</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,2}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,2}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"5.3-合取引入\">5.3 合取引入</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,3}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to(A\\wedge B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,3}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to(A\\wedge B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"5.4-合取消去一\">5.4 合取消去一</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,4}\n=\n\\{(A\\wedge B)\\to A:A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,4}\n=\n\\{(A\\wedge B)\\to A:A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"5.5-合取消去二\">5.5 合取消去二</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,5}\n=\n\\{(A\\wedge B)\\to B:A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,5}\n=\n\\{(A\\wedge B)\\to B:A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"5.6-析取引入一\">5.6 析取引入一</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,6}\n=\n\\{A\\to(A\\vee B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,6}\n=\n\\{A\\to(A\\vee B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"5.7-析取引入二\">5.7 析取引入二</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,7}\n=\n\\{B\\to(A\\vee B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,7}\n=\n\\{B\\to(A\\vee B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"5.8-析取消去\">5.8 析取消去</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,8}\n=\n\\{(A\\to C)\\to((B\\to C)\\to((A\\vee B)\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,8}\n=\n\\{(A\\to C)\\to((B\\to C)\\to((A\\vee B)\\to C)):\nA,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"5.9-排中\">5.9 排中</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,9}\n=\n\\{A\\vee\\neg A:A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,9}\n=\n\\{A\\vee\\neg A:A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"5.10-双重否定消去\">5.10 双重否定消去</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,10}\n=\n\\{\\neg\\neg A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,10}\n=\n\\{\\neg\\neg A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"5.11-受一致性约束的反证\">5.11 受一致性约束的反证</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,11}\n=\n\\left\\{\nB^\\circ\\to\n\\bigl((A\\to B)\\to((A\\to\\neg B)\\to\\neg A)\\bigr):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,11}\n=\n\\left\\{\nB^\\circ\\to\n\\bigl((A\\to B)\\to((A\\to\\neg B)\\to\\neg A)\\bigr):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"5.12-合取一致性传播\">5.12 合取一致性传播</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,12}\n=\n\\{(A^\\circ\\wedge B^\\circ)\\to(A\\wedge B)^\\circ:\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,12}\n=\n\\{(A^\\circ\\wedge B^\\circ)\\to(A\\wedge B)^\\circ:\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"5.13-析取一致性传播\">5.13 析取一致性传播</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,13}\n=\n\\{(A^\\circ\\wedge B^\\circ)\\to(A\\vee B)^\\circ:\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,13}\n=\n\\{(A^\\circ\\wedge B^\\circ)\\to(A\\vee B)^\\circ:\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"5.14-蕴含一致性传播\">5.14 蕴含一致性传播</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,14}\n=\n\\{(A^\\circ\\wedge B^\\circ)\\to(A\\to B)^\\circ:\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,14}\n=\n\\{(A^\\circ\\wedge B^\\circ)\\to(A\\to B)^\\circ:\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<p>分离规则显示为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>形式化为关系：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP,C1}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}^{2}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP,C1}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}^{2}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP,C1}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP,C1}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义总规则关系：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{C1}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP,C1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{C1}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP,C1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本系统没有量词推广、必然化、假设消去或独立命题代换规则；公理族已对任意公式封闭取实例。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明系统\">7. 证明系统</h1>\n<p>定义证明函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{C1}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1})\n\\to\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}^{&lt;\\omega}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prf}_{C1}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1})\n\\to\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}^{&lt;\\omega}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{C1}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Prf}_{C1}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 的元素是非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(C_0,C_1,\\ldots,C_{m-1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=(C_0,C_1,\\ldots,C_{m-1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\nm&gt;0,\n\\qquad\nC_j\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\quad(j&lt;m),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m\\in\\mathbb N,\n\\qquad\nm&gt;0,\n\\qquad\nC_j\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\quad(j&lt;m),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;m\">\\(j&lt;m\\)</span> 至少满足下列条件之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"7.1-假设行\">7.1 假设行</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_j\\in\\Gamma.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_j\\in\\Gamma.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"7.2-公理行\">7.2 公理行</h2>\n<p>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,14\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,14\\}\\)</span> 使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_j\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,i}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_j\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,i}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"7.3-分离规则行\">7.3 分离规则行</h2>\n<p>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,s&lt;j\">\\(r,s&lt;j\\)</span> 使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((C_r,C_s),C_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP,C1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((C_r,C_s),C_j)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP,C1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>等价地，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_r=A,\n\\qquad\nC_s=A\\to B,\n\\qquad\nC_j=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_r=A,\n\\qquad\nC_s=A\\to B,\n\\qquad\nC_j=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<p>定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{C1}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{C1}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(C_0,\\ldots,C_{m-1})\\in\\mathsf{Prf}_{C1}(\\Gamma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=(C_0,\\ldots,C_{m-1})\\in\\mathsf{Prf}_{C1}(\\Gamma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_{m-1}=A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_{m-1}=A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义无假设定理集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{C1}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{C1}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{C1}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{C1}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-整个句法形式系统\">9. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{C1}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{C1},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{C1},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{C1},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{C1},\n\\operatorname{Ext}_{C1},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,C1},\n(\\cdot)^\\circ,\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP,C1},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{C1},\n\\mathsf{Prf}_{C1},\n\\vdash_{C1},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{C1}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{C1}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{C1},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{C1},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{C1},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{C1},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{C1},\n\\operatorname{Ext}_{C1},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,C1},\n(\\cdot)^\\circ,\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP,C1},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{C1},\n\\mathsf{Prf}_{C1},\n\\vdash_{C1},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{C1}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统的目标差异是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^\\circ:=\\neg(A\\wedge\\neg A)\">\\(A^\\circ:=\\neg(A\\wedge\\neg A)\\)</span> 仅作为派生一致性公式，并通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,11}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,11}\\)</span> 控制反证、通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,12}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,12}\\)</span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,14}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1,14}\\)</span> 传播一致性；它既不把任意矛盾当作爆炸前提，也不把命名基逻辑作为未展开部件。</p>\n<p>该系统只含命题句法对象、命题替换、公理集合、分离规则、有限证明序列和可证性；不含真值矩阵、赋值、满足关系、语义有效性或底常元。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"789-da-Costa-相容逻辑-C_1","text":"789 da Costa 相容逻辑 C_1","level":1},{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"2.1-原子公式","text":"2.1 原子公式","level":2},{"id":"2.2-否定公式","text":"2.2 否定公式","level":2},{"id":"2.3-合取公式","text":"2.3 合取公式","level":2},{"id":"2.4-析取公式","text":"2.4 析取公式","level":2},{"id":"2.5-蕴含公式","text":"2.5 蕴含公式","level":2},{"id":"3.-自由变元与结构等同","text":"3. 自由变元与结构等同","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.1-蕴含一","text":"5.1 蕴含一","level":2},{"id":"5.2-蕴含二","text":"5.2 蕴含二","level":2},{"id":"5.3-合取引入","text":"5.3 合取引入","level":2},{"id":"5.4-合取消去一","text":"5.4 合取消去一","level":2},{"id":"5.5-合取消去二","text":"5.5 合取消去二","level":2},{"id":"5.6-析取引入一","text":"5.6 析取引入一","level":2},{"id":"5.7-析取引入二","text":"5.7 析取引入二","level":2},{"id":"5.8-析取消去","text":"5.8 析取消去","level":2},{"id":"5.9-排中","text":"5.9 排中","level":2},{"id":"5.10-双重否定消去","text":"5.10 双重否定消去","level":2},{"id":"5.11-受一致性约束的反证","text":"5.11 受一致性约束的反证","level":2},{"id":"5.12-合取一致性传播","text":"5.12 合取一致性传播","level":2},{"id":"5.13-析取一致性传播","text":"5.13 析取一致性传播","level":2},{"id":"5.14-蕴含一致性传播","text":"5.14 蕴含一致性传播","level":2},{"id":"6.-推理规则","text":"6. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明系统","text":"7. 证明系统","level":1},{"id":"7.1-假设行","text":"7.1 假设行","level":2},{"id":"7.2-公理行","text":"7.2 公理行","level":2},{"id":"7.3-分离规则行","text":"7.3 分离规则行","level":2},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个句法形式系统","text":"9. 整个句法形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}_{C1}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true}